      {
        "claim": "Across the 20 landmark soft_mass curves, whole-window z magnitudes are small (|z| < 0.65) while first_rate_z and last_rate_z are frequently large and opposite in sign, indicating strong within-window rate contrasts rather than a stationary level target.",
